["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Bird hunting means fast swings near other people. Most shotgun accidents happen when a bird pulls a muzzle across a partner.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three hunters walking in a line, seen from above. Each hunter shoots only inside a slice of about 45 degrees straight ahead. The ground between and behind hunters is a no shot zone. Stay level and in sight.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Walking in a line</text>\n<path d=\"M80 230 L22.6 91.4 A150 150 0 0 1 137.4 91.4 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" opacity=\"0.28\"/>\n<path d=\"M200 230 L142.6 91.4 A150 150 0 0 1 257.4 91.4 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" opacity=\"0.28\"/>\n<path d=\"M320 230 L262.6 91.4 A150 150 0 0 1 377.4 91.4 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" opacity=\"0.28\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"234\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"230\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"234\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"230\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"320\" cy=\"234\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"230\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"320.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"252\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\"/>\n<rect x=\"90.5\" y=\"267.0\" width=\"219.1\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Behind the line: never shoot</text>\n<rect x=\"106.1\" y=\"197.0\" width=\"67.7\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"214.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no shot</text>\n<rect x=\"226.1\" y=\"197.0\" width=\"67.7\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"214.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no shot</text>\n<rect x=\"37.6\" y=\"49.0\" width=\"84.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">your zone</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Each hunter shoots only in a slice about 45 degrees straight ahead <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Between and behind the line: never <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: zones of fire in full</summary><ul><li>A <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Zone of fire\">Zone of fire</button> is the only slice of ground or sky where you may shoot (75%, hunter education, <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/4\">Firearm safety</a>).</li><li>Walk side by side, always in sight. One gets ahead or behind: both stop and fix the line (75%, <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/5\">Firearm safety</a>).</li><li>Lose sight of each other: muzzles up or down, no shooting, call out <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Bright orange helps you see each other in timber. BC law does not require it <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. My lean: wear it (Tip).</li><li>Full partner plan: <a href=\"#/s/hunting-partner\">Hunting with a partner</a> and <a href=\"#/s/hunting-partner/4\">zones of fire, together</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two hunters in a blind, seen from above. Agree before first light: left hunter takes birds on the left, right hunter takes birds on the right. Never swing across your partner. Guns rest muzzle up or out the front.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">In a blind: left and right</text>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"190\" width=\"180\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n<path d=\"M160 215 L15.1 176.2 A150 150 0 0 1 160.0 65.0 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n<path d=\"M240 215 L240.0 65.0 A150 150 0 0 1 384.9 176.2 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"219\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"215\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"140.5\" y2=\"187.1\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"240\" cy=\"219\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"215\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"259.5\" y2=\"187.1\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<line x1=\"200\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/>\n<rect x=\"30.5\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"99.0\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"80.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">left: yours</text>\n<rect x=\"263.7\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"112.7\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"320.0\" y=\"80.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">right: theirs</text>\n<rect x=\"97.6\" y=\"254.0\" width=\"204.8\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"272.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">never across the middle</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Agree left and right before first light <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Never swing across your partner <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: blind rules</summary><ul><li>Shoot only birds on your side. Muzzles out the front, never across a partner (70%, <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/7\">Firearm safety</a>).</li><li>Guns rest muzzle up or out the front. Never leaned on the wall behind you (Tip).</li><li>Count birds out loud as they fall: you each need to know when the limit is reached (99% on the limit, Tip on the method, <a href=\"#/s/mc-geese-09/8\">Geese Masterclass</a>).</li><li>Earplugs: magnum loads damage hearing <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two hunters in a small boat, seen from above, sitting back to back: the bow hunter faces forward, the stern hunter faces back. Shoot sitting, only inside your own arc. Unload before anyone moves. Motor running: every gun unloaded.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">In a boat: back to back</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(-80 0)\">\n<path d=\"M200 50 C260 90 262 230 240 262 L160 262 C138 230 140 90 200 50 Z\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" opacity=\"0.55\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M200 120 L138.7 68.6 A80 80 0 0 1 261.3 68.6 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n<path d=\"M200 210 L261.3 261.4 A80 80 0 0 1 138.7 261.4 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"124\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"120\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"86.0\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"214\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"210\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"244.0\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"221.1\" y=\"53.0\" width=\"157.7\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"70.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">bow faces forward</text>\n<rect x=\"229.7\" y=\"253.0\" width=\"140.5\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"270.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">stern faces back</text>\n<circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"129.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"229.0\" y=\"129.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Sit to shoot</text>\n<circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"158\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"163.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"229.0\" y=\"163.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">One moves at a time</text>\n<circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"192\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"197.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"229.0\" y=\"197.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Motor on: unloaded</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Sit back to back. Sit to shoot. Never stand <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Motor pushing the boat: every gun unloaded <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the boat law and rules</summary><ul><li>BC Firearm Violence Prevention Act, in force 1 October 2026: no loaded firearm in or on a boat, with a hunting exemption when the boat has no motor or the motor is not moving it (95%, <a href=\"#/s/water-safety/4\">Water safety</a>).</li><li>Ducks and geese: no hunting from a moving boat with a motor or sail; drifting after you cut the motor still counts as moving (99%, s. 41, <a href=\"#/s/rb-migratory-birds/34\">Rule Book</a>).</li><li>One person moves at a time. Unload before anyone changes seats <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Recoil plus standing tips small boats (Tip, <a href=\"#/s/water-safety/5\">Water safety</a>).</li><li>My lean (from <a href=\"#/s/water-safety/4\">Water safety</a>): use the boat as a ride to a shore blind. Shoot from land.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout warn\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Low bird, no shot. A bird that flies low between or toward hunters, dogs or decoy setters is never shot. Swing only above the horizon line and inside your zone.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Low bird: no shot</text>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#dfe9f0\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"200\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#c9d3b4\"/>\n<line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(120.0 90.0) scale(1.3)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<path d=\"M158 86 L166.0 94.4 L182 76.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<rect x=\"54.1\" y=\"47.0\" width=\"131.8\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"120.0\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">high bird: maybe</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(250.0 186.0) scale(1.3)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<line x1=\"288\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"288\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"222\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"210\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/>\n<rect x=\"52.9\" y=\"228.0\" width=\"254.2\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"246.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">low bird toward a partner: NO</text>\n<rect x=\"71.5\" y=\"266.0\" width=\"256.9\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"284.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sky behind the bird, not people</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Only shoot with sky behind the bird (Tip).</li><li>A low bird toward a partner, a dog or a decoy setter: never (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why</summary><ul><li>Shot that misses keeps going. Sky is the only safe backdrop for a flying bird in a group (Tip).</li><li>Grouse Masterclass: \"low bird, no shot. Never swing toward a partner\" (Tip, <a href=\"#/s/mc-grouse-09/4\">Grouse Masterclass</a>).</li><li>Grouse in timber: stop and let the bird go if a partner is anywhere near your swing (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hand a shotgun over safely: 1 action open and proven empty, 2 muzzle in a safe direction, 3 the other person takes it, checks it themselves, and says they have it.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Handing it over</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"50\" width=\"376\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"78.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"83.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"75.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Open and empty</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"92.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Bolt back, or broken open.</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"114\" width=\"376\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"142.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"147.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"139.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">Muzzle safe</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"156.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Ground or sky. Never across a person.</text>\n<rect x=\"12\" y=\"178\" width=\"376\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"206.0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"211.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"203.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">They check it too</text>\n<text x=\"54.0\" y=\"220.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">They look, feel, then say &quot;got it&quot;.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"286.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same at a fence, a ditch or the truck.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Open, empty, muzzle safe. They check it too <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span>.</li><li>Unload before a fence, a ditch or a log <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: in full</summary><ul><li>Do ACTS and PROVE every time you pick up, put down, hand over or receive a firearm (80%, <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/3\">Firearm safety</a>).</li><li>Browning: \"ALWAYS UNLOAD YOUR FIREARM'S CHAMBERS BEFORE CROSSING A FENCE, CLIMBING A TREE, JUMPING A DITCH OR NEGOTIATING OTHER OBSTACLES\" (95%, Citori manual).</li><li>Browning also: never lean a gun on a fence, tree or car <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Beretta: never take a gun from another person unless the action is open and checked empty (95%, A300 manual).</li><li>Fences and ditches step by step: <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety/8\">Firearm safety</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Check the bore for obstructions: snow, mud or a wad can block a barrel. Unload, open the action and look through from the breech, or run a rod through. Never shoot to clear a blocked barrel.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Barrel blocked? Never shoot it out</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"110\" width=\"360\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"116\" width=\"360\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cfd5d8\"/>\n<path d=\"M330 117 C340 112 350 122 360 117 L360 143 C350 148 340 138 330 143 Z\" fill=\"#f4f8fb\" stroke=\"#17201A\"/>\n<line x1=\"345.0\" y1=\"98.0\" x2=\"345.0\" y2=\"117.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"345.0\" cy=\"117.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"276.8\" y=\"75.0\" width=\"106.5\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"330.0\" y=\"92.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">snow or mud</text>\n<circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"180\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"184.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"48.0\" y=\"185.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unload, action open</text>\n<circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"208\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"212.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"48.0\" y=\"213.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Look through from the breech</text>\n<circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"236\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"240.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"48.0\" y=\"241.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Push it out with a rod</text>\n<circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"264\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"268.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"48.0\" y=\"269.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Never fire to clear it</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Snow, mud or a stuck wad can burst a barrel <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Unload, look from the breech, push it out with a rod <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the manual's words</summary><ul><li>Remington: \"Even a small amount of snow, mud, excess lubricant or grease in the bore can dangerously increase pressure and cause the barrel to bulge or burst\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>\"NEVER try to remove an object from the barrel by loading a cartridge and firing\" (95%, 870 manual).</li><li>If a rod will not move it: a gunsmith <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Beretta: never look into the barrel from the muzzle <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): The bird you let go is never the one you regret.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Swinging past your partner's shoulder on a bird.</li><li>Standing up in the boat for a better angle.</li><li>Crossing a ditch with a shell in the chamber.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Before first light, both say out loud: my side, your side, no low birds, unload to move.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Laws via the app Rule Book and water safety lesson (95 to 99%). Maker manuals <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Hunter education (70 to 80%). Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li>Migratory Birds Regulations, 2022, s. 41 (moving boat), via the app Rule Book <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li>BC Firearm Violence Prevention Act, ss. 4 and 5 and the hunting exemption, via <a href=\"#/s/water-safety\">Water safety</a> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rem870.com/remington_model_870_manual.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Remington Model 870 instruction book, form RD 7058</a>: obstructions. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.browning.com/content/dam/browning/support/owners-manuals/2021/21-BFA-299_Citori%20OM_WEB.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Browning Citori owner's manual (2021)</a>: obstacles, obstructions. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://berettaweb.com/Munuals/Beretta%20Owner%20Manual%20A300%20Outlander%20LD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Beretta A300 Outlander instruction manual, 09/2011</a>: handing over. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li>Zones of fire and carries: hunter education, via <a href=\"#/s/firearm-safety\">Firearm safety</a> (75 to 85%)</li></ul></details>"]